    <div class="aura-grid-head">⚜️ <strong>What to look for</strong> — the boss spawns with a <em>random</em> Paladin aura (the icon floats over its head). Bind, read the icon, then <strong>save &amp; exit &amp; rebind</strong> until you hit ⭐ <strong style="color:var(--best)">Fanaticism</strong>. Levels shown at mlvl ${mlvl} (a Terror Zone) where Fanaticism reaches its level-12 cap.</div>
