  "Flail (Heart of the Oak base)": { rarity:'basic', base:'Flail', cat:'Runeword bases', val:'mid', desc:"The classic low-requirement <b>Heart of the Oak</b> base (also Crystal Sword) — the caster's +3-skills/40-res weapon. A Flail's max is <b>5 sockets</b>, but HotO needs exactly <b>4</b> — so <b>cube it</b> for a random 1–5 roll (or find a 4os). <b>Don't Larzuk it</b>: Larzuk gives the max (5), which overshoots the 4 HotO needs." },
