// v596 — FORGE→VAULT CONSUME SYNC (Konyo: "after i click created on forge it needs to automatically
// get taken out of the vault — not showing again and again the same socketed base"). Marking a
// runeword ✓ created CONSUMES the owned base the Forge planned it on: the base physically BECAME the
// runeword, so its vault entry leaves (one copy of a ×N stack decrements; the last copy unowns the
// label, exactly like the vault's ✕). d2r_rwBaseUsed remembers what was consumed per word, so
