// ═══ v331 — AI Diablo II Helper. A Sonnet-powered assistant (backend functions/api/ask.js) that
// answers "what can I make right now & how" from the player's LIVE tallies. It AUGMENTS the manual
// tally: the four 📸 intakes still feed the counts; this reads them + the bible's own makeable-now
